---
import { buttonVariants } from "@/components/ui/button";
---

<section class="py-24 bg-white text-[#052d3f]">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      <div class="order-2 md:order-1">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-display font-bold mb-6 text-[#052d3f]">
          Rooted in legacy, built for the future.
        </h2>
        
        <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-[#052d3f]/90 space-y-6">
          <p>
            In the Room with Legacy™ was born from a sacred lived experience.
          </p>
          <p>
            When founder Lauren Rosa Miller walked alongside her father through the final chapter of his life, she witnessed what it truly means to pass the baton. Not just property or possessions, but purpose, love, and responsibility.
          </p>
          <p>
            Through that journey, Lauren saw how much families can gain, and lose, in the silence between generations. She also recognized that legacy isn't luck or wealth alone; it's structure, intention, and the courage to move as a family on purpose.
          </p>
          <p>
            What began as a deeply personal awakening became a framework for others — helping families preserve their stories, align their values, and build systems that carry blessings forward with discipline and love.
          </p>
          <p>
            Legacy isn't just inherited — it's built, lived, and sustained together.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="mt-8">
          <a 
            href="/about/founder-letter" 
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 h-10 rounded-md px-8 bg-[#052d3f] text-white hover:bg-[#052d3f]/90"
          >
            Read the Letter from Our Founder
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="order-1 md:order-2 relative">
        <div class="rounded-lg overflow-hidden shadow-xl relative">
          <img 
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1707995673778-f7ded37a4c17?w=400&h=600&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80" 
            alt="Lauren Rosa Miller, Founder of In the Room with Legacy" 
            class="w-full h-auto object-cover aspect-[3/4]"
          />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent to-black/50"></div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Decorative element -->
        <div class="absolute -bottom-6 -left-6 w-40 h-40 rounded-lg bg-secondary/50 -z-10"></div>
        <div class="absolute -top-6 -right-6 w-24 h-24 rounded-lg border-2 border-white/40 -z-10"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>